{"seq":1,"slug":"saga-orchestration-vs-choreography","title":"Saga 拓扑：编排式与协同式长事务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transaction-consistency-patterns/saga-long-transactions/saga-orchestration-vs-choreography","wordCount":2712,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"saga-拓扑-编排式与协同式长事务\">Saga 拓扑：编排式与协同式长事务</h1><p>一笔横跨订单、库存、支付三个库的下单流程，在任意一次网络抖动后都可能停在「扣了库存但没收到款」的中间态。Saga 给出的答案是：把这笔长事务拆成一串各自本地原子的步骤，用<strong>补偿（compensating transaction）<strong>代替回滚。但真正决定这套系统能不能运维的，不是「要不要用 Saga」，而是</strong>这串本地事务由谁驱动</strong>——一个持有全局状态、主动发号施令的编排者，还是参与者之间靠事件彼此接力的协同网络。这个拓扑选择一旦定错，后期推翻的代价远高于写错一个补偿接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Saga 被定义为「<strong>一串本地事务（a sequence of local transactions）</strong>」：每个本地事务只更新某一个服务的数据库，并发出消息或事件触发下一个事务；当某个步骤因业务规则失败时，Saga 执行一系列补偿事务，撤销之前已完成步骤造成的影响（<a href=\"https://microservices.io/patterns/data/saga.html\">microservices.io: Saga</a>）。它出现的前提是 <strong>Database per Service</strong>——当每个微服务拥有独立数据库时，跨服务的 2PC「不是一个选项」（&quot;2PC is not an option&quot;，同上）。这也是 Saga 与 2PC 的心智差异：2PC 用锁与阻塞换原子性（机制见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../commit-protocols-2pc-tcc/two-phase-commit-internals\">2PC 内部机制</a>），Saga 用可见的中间态与补偿逻辑换可用性。</p>\n<p>两种拓扑在控制流上的差异可以直观对照：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  subgraph ORCH[编排式 Orchestration]&#10;    O[Saga 编排者&lt;br/&gt;持有状态 · 发命令 · 收回复]&#10;    O --&gt;|Reserve Credit| CS1[客户服务]&#10;    O --&gt;|Reserve Stock| IS1[库存服务]&#10;    O --&gt;|Charge| PS1[支付服务]&#10;    CS1 --&gt;|reply| O&#10;    IS1 --&gt;|reply| O&#10;    PS1 --&gt;|reply| O&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph CHOR[协同式 Choreography]&#10;    OS[订单服务] --&gt;|Order Created| CS2[客户服务]&#10;    CS2 --&gt;|Credit Reserved| OS&#10;    OS --&gt;|Order Approved| PS2[支付服务]&#10;    PS2 --&gt;|Payment Taken| IS2[库存服务]&#10;  end\">graph TD\n  subgraph ORCH[编排式 Orchestration]\n    O[Saga 编排者&lt;br/&gt;持有状态 · 发命令 · 收回复]\n    O --&gt;|Reserve Credit| CS1[客户服务]\n    O --&gt;|Reserve Stock| IS1[库存服务]\n    O --&gt;|Charge| PS1[支付服务]\n    CS1 --&gt;|reply| O\n    IS1 --&gt;|reply| O\n    PS1 --&gt;|reply| O\n  end\n  subgraph CHOR[协同式 Choreography]\n    OS[订单服务] --&gt;|Order Created| CS2[客户服务]\n    CS2 --&gt;|Credit Reserved| OS\n    OS --&gt;|Order Approved| PS2[支付服务]\n    PS2 --&gt;|Payment Taken| IS2[库存服务]\n  end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>编排式 Orchestration</th>\n<th>协同式 Choreography</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>控制点</td>\n<td>中央编排者对象</td>\n<td>无中央控制者，参与者相互反应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触发方式</td>\n<td>编排者下发命令，参与者回回复</td>\n<td>本地事务发布领域事件，触发他方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>耦合方向</td>\n<td>参与者只依赖编排者</td>\n<td>参与者需消费彼此的（命令与）事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单点故障</td>\n<td>编排者是故障点</td>\n<td>责任分散，无单点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试</td>\n<td>可对编排者单独打桩</td>\n<td>需拉起全部服务才能模拟一笔事务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合规模</td>\n<td>复杂流程、服务多</td>\n<td>简单流程、服务少、无需集中协调逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>上表的对照条目直接来自 Microsoft Azure 架构中心对两种实现路径的利弊总结（<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/patterns/saga\">Microsoft Learn: Saga Design Pattern</a>，页面 <code>updated_at</code> 2026-06-03）。留意一个反直觉点：<strong>编排式引入的是「协调复杂性 + 单点」，协同式引入的是「可追踪性差 + 循环依赖风险」</strong>——两者都不是免费的，选择的是不同种类的债务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"编排式-中央指挥者\">编排式：中央指挥者</h2><p>编排式的定义是「<strong>一个编排者对象告诉参与者该执行哪些本地事务</strong>」（<a href=\"https://microservices.io/patterns/data/saga.html\">microservices.io</a>）。以订单流程为例：订单服务创建 Create Order 编排者，编排者先建一个 <code>PENDING</code> 订单，再向客户服务发 <code>Reserve Credit</code> 命令，收到回复后决定批准或拒绝订单——决策逻辑集中在编排者，参与者只是「执行 + 回报」。</p>\n<p>一个成熟的编排实现应当把长事务状态<strong>持久化到存储</strong>，而不是留在内存里，否则编排者进程崩溃就会让整笔 Saga 成为孤儿。Axon Framework 的 Saga 实现是这一思路的样本（文档版本 <strong>Axon Framework 5.3</strong>，<a href=\"https://docs.axoniq.io/axon-framework-reference/5.0/sagas/\">Axon Reference: Sagas</a>）：一个 Saga 是管理单笔长业务事务的<strong>事件监听器</strong>，用 <code>@SagaEventHandler</code> 声明处理逻辑，用 <code>AssociationValue</code>（键值对，如 <code>orderId → 123</code>）把事件路由到「当前事务」对应的 Saga 实例——<code>@SagaEventHandler(associationProperty = &quot;orderId&quot;)</code> 会读取事件属性并派发到关联该值的 Saga（<a href=\"https://docs.axoniq.io/axon-framework-reference/5.0/sagas/implementation/\">Axon: Saga Implementation</a>）。生命周期的起点是 <code>@StartSaga</code>（默认仅在无匹配 Saga 时新建，<code>forceNew = true</code> 可强制新建），终点是 <code>@EndSaga</code> 或 <code>SagaLifecycle.end()</code>。</p>\n<p>持久化链路由 <code>AnnotatedSagaManager → SagaRepository → SagaStore</code> 组成，官方内置 <code>InMemorySagaStore</code>（默认，进程关闭即丢失）、JPA、JDBC、Mongo 四种 store——细节不重要，要义是<strong>编排者的状态必须可重建</strong>，否则「重启不丢」只是口号。</p>\n<p>Axon 文档明确写道「<strong>Saga 在 Axon Framework 5 中尚无替代方案</strong>」（&quot;Sagas do not have a replacement yet in Axon Framework 5&quot;，<a href=\"https://docs.axoniq.io/axon-framework-reference/5.0/sagas/\">Axon Reference</a>）——该框架正处在新旧 Saga 能力交替期，选型时要把这条演进风险计入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"协同式-事件接力\">协同式：事件接力</h2><p>协同式的定义是「<strong>每个本地事务发布领域事件，去触发其他服务中的本地事务</strong>」，系统中不存在中央控制者（<a href=\"https://microservices.io/patterns/data/saga.html\">microservices.io</a>）。订单流程在协同式下被重写为：订单服务创建 <code>PENDING</code> 状态订单并发布 <code>Order Created</code>；客户服务监听该事件、尝试预留信用额度，并发布信用结果；订单服务再根据该事件批准或拒绝订单。</p>\n<p>这条链路的美感在于<strong>没有额外组件</strong>：每个服务只需订阅自己关心的事件。代价则是可追踪性与耦合形态。Azure 文档把协同式的收益与代价列得很直白——收益是「适合服务少、无集中协调逻辑的简单流程」「无需额外协调服务」「责任分散、无单点故障」；代价是「新增步骤后流程会变得混乱」「难以追踪每个参与者响应哪些命令」「参与者之间存在<strong>循环依赖风险</strong>，因为它们必须消费彼此的命令」「集成测试困难，因为必须运行所有服务才能模拟一笔事务」（<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/patterns/saga\">Microsoft Learn: Saga</a>）。</p>\n<p>用事件耦合的<strong>复杂度量级</strong>可以量化这种代价。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个参与者，协同式下每个参与者都可能发布事件、也要消费其他参与者的事件，最坏情况下耦合关系数随参与者数呈</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{choreography} \\sim O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>而编排式中每个参与者只与编排者单向交互，耦合关系数退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{orchestration} \\sim O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这解释了为什么「服务一多就该收口到编排」不是教条，而是耦合度随规模二次增长的必然结果——协同式真正的适用区间是<strong>少参与者、少步骤、且流程稳定</strong>的场景。## 补偿语义：可补偿 / 枢纽 / 可重试</p>\n<p>补偿不是「逆操作」那么简单。Azure 把 Saga 中的本地事务按补偿能力划分为三类（<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/patterns/saga\">Microsoft Learn: Saga</a>）：<strong>可补偿事务（compensable）</strong>——能被相反效果的事务撤销，某步骤失败时撤销所有可补偿事务的改动；<strong>枢纽事务（pivot）</strong>——Saga 的<strong>不归点（point of no return）</strong>，一旦成功，之前的可补偿事务不再需要补偿，其后所有动作都必须完成才能到达一致终态；<strong>可重试事务（retryable）</strong>——位于枢纽之后，<strong>幂等</strong>，负责在暂时性故障下把 Saga 推向终态。</p>\n<p>设正向步骤为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_1, t_2, \\dots, t_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，枢纽位于第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 步之后，则一个失败触发的补偿序列应按<strong>逆序</strong>执行前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 步的补偿：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>∘</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>∘</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>∘</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = c_{k-1} \\circ c_{k-2} \\circ \\dots \\circ c_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6528em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∘</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6528em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∘</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∘</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>枢纽之后的步骤不做补偿，只做重试（因为它们幂等）。这条设计纪律源于 Saga 的根本性质：与 ACID 事务不同，Saga <strong>没有自动回滚</strong>，所有补偿都必须显式设计（<a href=\"https://microservices.io/patterns/data/saga.html\">microservices.io</a>）。而且补偿本身<strong>可能失败</strong>——Azure 明确把「补偿事务可能并不总是成功，从而让系统停留在不一致状态」列为该模式的局限（<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/patterns/saga\">Microsoft Learn: Saga</a>），因此补偿路径同样需要重试与人工兜底出口。</p>\n<p>缺少隔离（Saga 放弃了 ACID 的「I」）会带来三类典型数据异常（同上）：<strong>丢失更新（lost updates）</strong>——一个 Saga 覆盖了另一个 Saga 的改动；<strong>脏读（dirty reads）</strong>——读到另一个 Saga 尚未完成修改的数据；<strong>模糊读/不可重复读（fuzzy reads）</strong>——同一步骤内两次读取之间数据被他人改动。对抗手段包括：<strong>语义锁（semantic lock）</strong>，用应用级信号量标记「更新进行中」；<strong>交换律更新（commutative updates）</strong>，让更新顺序无关；<strong>悲观视图</strong>，把易脏读的更新挪到可重试阶段；<strong>重读校验</strong>，提交前确认数据未变；<strong>版本文件</strong>，按正确序列记录操作。microservices.io 订单示例里那个 <code>PENDING</code> 状态，本质就是最朴素的语义锁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"拓扑选择矩阵与混合形态\">拓扑选择矩阵与混合形态</h2><p>把上面的性质落成选型依据，可以按流程特征直接查表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判断项</th>\n<th>倾向编排式</th>\n<th>倾向协同式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>参与者数量</td>\n<td>多（≥5 个服务）</td>\n<td>少（2–4 个）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>步骤是否频繁新增</td>\n<td>是，需集中改动</td>\n<td>否，流程稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否需要全局视图</td>\n<td>是，强可观测性诉求</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队边界</td>\n<td>单一团队掌管全流程</td>\n<td>各团队自治、松耦合优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环依赖风险</td>\n<td>高（需打断循环）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试可行性</td>\n<td>可对编排者打桩</td>\n<td>需全量拉起服务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Azure 的最终建议：当你需要「在不紧耦合的前提下保证分布式数据一致性」、或「序列中某个操作失败时要能回滚/补偿」时使用该模式；而当<strong>事务彼此紧耦合</strong>、<strong>补偿发生在前序参与者上</strong>、或<strong>存在循环依赖</strong>时，该模式可能并不合适（<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/patterns/saga\">Microsoft Learn: Saga</a>）。实践中更常见的是<strong>混合形态</strong>：把「跨领域、需要全局视图」的长流程收口到一个编排者，领域内部仍用协同式的事件接力，使编排者的状态机保持精瘦。无论哪种拓扑，两条底线不变——更新数据库与发布事件必须原子完成（<strong>Transactional Outbox</strong> / <strong>Event Sourcing</strong>），且所有可重试步骤必须<strong>幂等</strong>（Idempotent Consumer），因为至少一次投递意味着重复执行是常态（同上）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Saga 是<strong>一串本地事务</strong>，用补偿代替回滚；前提是 Database per Service 让跨服务 2PC 不可用。</li>\n<li>拓扑二选一：<strong>编排式</strong>由中央编排者发命令、收回复、持状态；<strong>协同式</strong>由参与者发布/消费事件彼此接力，无中央控制者。</li>\n<li>编排式的债务是<strong>协调复杂性 + 单点故障</strong>，换来集中决策与可对编排者单独打桩的测试性；协同式的债务是<strong>追踪困难 + 循环依赖风险 + 集成测试需全量拉起</strong>，换来无额外组件、无单点。</li>\n<li>耦合复杂度上，协同式约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、编排式约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——服务一多，编排收口就是自然选择。</li>\n<li>补偿按<strong>可补偿 / 枢纽 / 可重试</strong>三段划分；枢纽是不归点，之后只重试不补偿；补偿按逆序执行且本身可能失败，需重试与人工兜底。</li>\n<li>失去隔离会引发<strong>丢失更新、脏读、模糊读</strong>，对抗手段有语义锁、交换律更新、悲观视图、重读校验、版本文件。</li>\n<li>两条底线：<strong>Outbox/Event Sourcing</strong> 保证「改库 + 发事件」原子；<strong>幂等</strong>保证重复执行安全；大规模系统常用<strong>混合形态</strong>（跨域用编排、域内用协同）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Saga 拓扑：编排式与协同式长事务","id":"saga-拓扑-编排式与协同式长事务"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"编排式：中央指挥者","id":"编排式-中央指挥者"},{"level":2,"text":"协同式：事件接力","id":"协同式-事件接力"},{"level":2,"text":"拓扑选择矩阵与混合形态","id":"拓扑选择矩阵与混合形态"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"TCC 三阶段预留：Try-Confirm-Cancel 与资源锁定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transaction-consistency-patterns/commit-protocols-2pc-tcc/tcc-reservation-model"},"next":{"title":"补偿事务设计：语义反向与幂等可重试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transaction-consistency-patterns/saga-long-transactions/compensating-transaction-design"}}